      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `b945e14a3266f51d5496b8fe3d559c7b8c48a5933706760052f51a2cebcac64e--recorded-crime-offenders-2024-25-cube-2-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Offenders (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2024\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 13 of 13\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 97c6ef7b4e85a07603ce88b702dca63ccaeecf3d34eccefff656936fce7e8943 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 9a084fc757295089f2d5f99e21d91da228a1cbd54270466db0dac18876da533a | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 23d7b668e0d91c86b04231166937978fe7463891383f5aee8c4e9a7e76670d32 | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | fd1a8ed3cdbe69bfe4e1fe4d99834b5f817bc5a75bb649d8c025a39f44e71cc4 | missing |\n| \"Table 9\" | d55e89870793732a59c34fed2f8584138fbb819b6b260a6804bb4ba82470b24a | missing |\n| \"Table 10\" | e9e30f07d081a14d051d49b0a807ade976db010cf3b3b4aa7c8b8a6732181df5 | missing |\n| \"Table 11\" | 687de740631f8877c86bbdb4dcf507a2e5f326b22200eb92bff20aac465a80a3 | missing |\n| \"Table 12\" | 008610ff3f77a1bac9f22b835c08e46e7f69977b2b5dd75ca36cb1d6e4e2279d | missing |\n| \"Table 13\" | b5a34097d2c839b95d81afedc62e1f390613955edc0315db37ff18ec54df7ca6 | missing |\n| \"Table 14\" | 6335313f423355a4195d34e026f78b992807979321c87dae5147c29e6a3b7259 | missing |\n| \"Table 15\" | c435748a1ee7ce358afe08b75888518b58a8833f02180e08f83b777b85203807 | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | d3e586a853e2ed6946d20ae0d1d24cef9246bf91909a556892f806927cdfae46 | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | 3eab91c212c97a00afe3674f9f4ce6a20421a6b0de5d15c8e4414ebeac84a3f4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `diction